cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "mode-resolved-calibration: mode-resolved calibration-confidence continuum for photometric inverse problems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "calibinfo authors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dddsx3/mode-resolved-calibration"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the mode-resolved calibration-confidence continuum:
  Schur-complement Delta-Fisher information, calibration-retention spectra, the
  gauge closed-form spectral response, and the mode-resolved severity analysis on
  OpenIllumination (11 objects x 6 levels, 20 seeds; RA = 0.90, stratified median
  0.536 vs 0.418/0.400). Includes frozen results, independent headline recomputation
  tests (pytest), and figure/table regeneration scripts.
keywords:
  - photometric inverse problems
  - calibration
  - Fisher information
  - Schur complement
  - spectral analysis
  - OpenIllumination